OL,3,GNEWSAAnother school votes to strike
OL,4,Aover Catholic academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnion members at another school have
OL,7,Fvoted for strike action over plans to
OL,8,Fturn Catholic schools into academy
OL,9,Ftrusts in the north-west of England.
OL,11,FSeveral schools in Lancashire and on
OL,12,FMerseyside have taken industrial action
OL,13,Fover proposals for more than 200
OL,14,Fschools to move into academy trusts.
OL,16,FThe National Education Union (NEU) said
OL,17,Fa ballot of members at Christ The King
OL,18,FCatholic Primary School in Liverpool
OL,19,Fshowed they would strike if their
OL,20,Fdemands were ignored by the governing
OL,21,Fbody of the school.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
