OL,3,GNEWSAAnother school votes to strike
OL,4,Aover Catholic academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FNEU members believe the plans have been
OL,7,Fimposed by the Archdiocese of Liverpool
OL,8,Frather than proposed by their governing
OL,9,Fbody. The BBC has contacted the
OL,10,FArchdiocese of Liverpool for comment.
